{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/949564-disembodied-and-non-humanoid-prometheans","id":949564,"title":"Disembodied and non-humanoid Prometheans","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-12T15:17:19-07:00","id":949564,"title":"Disembodied and non-humanoid Prometheans","content":"So, since Promethean is one of the main avenues that ChroD has to explore stories about artificial intelligence, I've been working over the possibility of Prometheans not being tied to one humanoid body. Some sort of ability allowing their consciousness to separate from it could be useful, and it could be done in several ways: as allowing them to &quot;digitize&quot; their minds, or in a spiritual way by allowing them to disembody themselves into ephemeral entities. <br /> <br /> One possible thing I was considering was to say that a Promethean could only achieve a radically non-humanoid form through their New Dawn. So an Unfleshed could progress to the point of permanently severing their consciousness from their body and turning it into a disembodied data intelligence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T16:00:40-07:00","id":949588,"title":"","content":"I'm really really confused as to why this seems needed, the book mentions specifically it is possible for data to become sentient, as shown in the Unfleshed section.. Ila is her name I believe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T16:03:48-07:00","id":949591,"title":"","content":"Well, the book doesn't really have gameplay mechanics for playing a Promethean that exists as data or wants to become a disembodied data entity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T16:24:03-07:00","id":949603,"title":"","content":"Hmm... My response to that would be that it could be handled in character backstory for the first part, or they could work on a fun segment where the character interfaces with electronic devices. And the latter could be a good npc or pc showing a descent into the path of Flux, since as an end goal that runs entirely counter to the New Dawn and the achievement of humanity. In terms of mechanics of course the digitization would grant massive bonuses to computers whilst leaving the body vulnerable and comatose. Perhaps an additional negative to social pools for some time afterwards as a result of shedding human perspective for a time, since a physical form is integral to that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T16:31:27-07:00","id":949612,"title":"","content":"Well, the New Dawn no longer exclusively means becoming human in The Lightning Chronicle. I like the idea that you can't completely leave your body unless you reach that stage, which is an incentive for Prometheans who want to be bodiless AIs to pursue it. <br /> <br /> So I think it's as simple as adding it as an Athanor or Transmutation, but I still need to work out the gameplay stuff about that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T19:05:36-07:00","id":949700,"title":"","content":"You really should provide a disclaimer when you post an idea that's designed with your homebrew in mind. As for the subject at hand, I think this would be best represented as some sort of Bestowment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T19:31:22-07:00","id":949714,"title":"","content":"In the <i>Beast: The Primordial</i> corebook, in the setting chapter's section on Tokyo, there's a hologram 'idol' on the verge of becoming an Extempore. So, yeah. It's doable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T19:53:43-07:00","id":949739,"title":"","content":"Again, the problem is that upon becoming a Promethean they wouldn't be able to be a hologram again, and that's what I'm going for. <br /> <br /> The problem with making it a Bestowment is that I see it as a very personal thing that a Promethean decides they want based on Identity. Hence, an Athanor. I'm not considering this to be something anywhere near a lot of Prometheans would want to do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}